OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after car crashes into
OL,4,Aparked vehicle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after a car crashed into
OL,7,Fa parked vehicle in Leicester.
OL,9,FLeicestershire Police said a grey
OL,10,FVolkswagen Golf crashed in Chesterfield
OL,11,FRoad just before 05:49 GMT on Saturday.
OL,13,FThe man - one of two occupants in the
OL,14,FGolf - sustained serious injuries and
OL,15,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FAnother man was taken to hospital with
OL,17,Fminor injuries and was discharged after
OL,18,Ftreatment, the force added.
OL,20,FA 29-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,22,Fdriving and remains in police custody.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
